    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Turn-Key 3-Bedroom House with Self-Contained Basement Apartment, Workshop & Garage.\r\n\r\nA superb turn-key property set on approximately 0.53 hectares (1.31 acres) of beautifully landscaped grounds, located just 2km from Newport town.\r\nBuilt in 2007 and fully completed in 2020, this well-presented property offers excellent versatility and additional accommodation, making it ideal as a family home or potential rental opportunity.\r\nThe main house comprises three bedrooms, with a one-bedroom self-contained apartment in the basement, providing valuable additional living space.\r\nThe property also benefits from a substantial workshop, incorporating a dedicated office and WC, making it particularly attractive to those working from home or requiring workshop/storage facilities.\r\nExternally, the property features a landscaped garden and tarmac driveway, along with a garage providing secure parking and storage.\r\nThe home is equipped with a biomass boiler and 14 photovoltaic solar panels, offering energy-efficient heating and renewable electricity generation."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ACCOMMODATION:\r\n\r\nPorch:  2.11m  x  2.07m\r\nComposite front door.\r\nCarpet.\r\nDouble doors to hall.\r\n\r\nEntrance hall:  4m  x  2.02m\r\nCarpet.\r\n\r\nCorridor:  6m  x  1.2m\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining.  \r\nL Shaped.\r\nDining area:  5.03m  x  3.15m\r\nLaminate floor.\r\nKitchen:  3.5m  x  2.82m\r\nFitted kitchen with granite effect worktop.\r\nVinly floor covering.\r\nOverlooks the rear garden.\r\n\r\nUtility:  2.66m  x  2.43m\r\nFitted units.\r\nBuilt in dishwasher, washing machine & tumble dryer.\r\nTiled floor.\r\n\r\nSunroom/Conservatory:  4.3m  x  2.6m\r\nSliding door to verandah.\r\nDouble doors to sitting room.\r\nCarpet tiles.\r\n\r\nSitting Room:  8.48m  x  4.43m\r\nMulti fuel stove.\r\nDouble doors to the conservatory.\r\nCarpet.\r\n\r\nMaster/Bedroom 1:  3.93m  x  3.7m\r\nFront of house.\r\nSpace for fitted wardrobe. (Not fitted)\r\nCarpet.\r\nEnsuite:  2.57m  x  1m\r\nTastefully tiled floor & walls.\r\nLarge walk in wet room shower.\r\nWC & WHB.\r\nHeated towel rail.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2:  4.46m  x  3.44m\r\nOverlooking the rear garden.\r\nWalk in wardrobe.\r\nCarpet.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3:  3.92m  x  3.7m\r\nOverlooking the front garden.\r\nSpace for fitted wardrobe. (not fitted)\r\n\r\nMain bathroom:  3.1m  x  2.8m\r\nTastefully tiled floor & walls.\r\nLarge walk in wet room shower.\r\nBath, WC, bidet & vanity wash basin.\r\n\r\nBasement- 1 bedroom apartment.\r\nLiving/kitchen:  \tL shaped        4.60m  x  3.34m\r\n\t          \t\t         1.91m  x  1.8m\r\nDouble doors to rear garden.\r\nReady for fitting out.\r\n\r\nBedroom:  5.2m  x  3.81m\r\n\r\nBathroom:  2.69m  x  1.78m\r\nTiled walls & floor.\r\nWalk in shower/wet room.\r\nWC & vanity WHB.\r\nHeated towel rail.\r\n\r\nArea of apartment:  44.70sqm\r\n\r\nAttic space ready for conversion with all services laid on.\r\n\r\nWorkshop:  12.29m  x  6.1m\r\nIncludes office & WC\r\nPlant for heating system and wood pellet boiler.\r\nFitted units & sink.\r\n\r\nGarage:  8.6m  x  4.15m\r\nBlock wall.\r\nConcrete floor.\r\nRoller door."
